{"seq":33,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"61a1f0f1-8f86-425d-8d44-923f93c1b982","runId":"run_1_1788554593318","result":"The regex has been saved to `/app/regex.txt`. Here's how it works:\n\n**Key components:**\n\n1. **IPv4 validation** `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4]\\d|1\\d{2}|[1-9]?\\d)`:\n   - Matches 250-255, 200-249, 100-199, and 0-99 respectively\n   - Prevents leading zeros in octets\n\n2. **Date validation** with month-specific day ranges:\n   - Months 01,03,05,07,08,10,12 → days 01-31\n   - Months 04,06,09,11 → days 01-30\n   - Month 02 → days 01-29 (as required)\n\n3. **Last date matching**: The negative lookahead `(?!.*\\b\\d{4}...)\\b)` ensures only the last date on a line is captured\n\n4. **Word boundaries**: `\\b` prevents matching dates/IPs with adjacent alphanumerics (e.g., \"1234-12-1234\" in \"user1234-12-1234\" won't match)\n\n5. **Line filtering**: Positive lookahead verifies the line contains an IPv4 before attempting to match a date\n\nWhen used with `re.findall(pattern, log_text, re.MULTILINE)`, it returns only the last date from lines containing at least one valid IPv4 address.","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":98882,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"61a1f0f1-8f86-425d-8d44-923f93c1b982","total_cost_usd":0.09864585,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15527,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":15069,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":14118},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":15527},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":560,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14584,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14584,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInput